<section class="pk-hero"><canvas id="snow" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><div class="pk-hero-i pxw"><img data-px=".14" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544878116-c9a79905435a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1900&h=1200&q=75" alt="a person walking through deep snow in a winter coat" width="1900" height="1200" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="pk-w pk-hero-g"><div class="pk-frost"><p class="pk-ey"><svg class="pk-fl" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"><path d="M20 3v34M5 11l30 18M5 29l30-18"/><path d="M15 6l5 5 5-5M15 34l5-5 5 5M4 17l7 3-2 7M36 17l-7 3 2 7M4 23l7-3M36 23l-7-3"/></g></svg> Cold-weather field guide</p><h1>PARKAIO</h1><p>Parkas explained for the coldest days: how warm, how long, which hood and what to put underneath.</p><div class="pk-hero-a"><a class="pk-btn" href="how-to-choose-a-parka.html">Choose a parka</a><a class="pk-lnk" href="#chill">Wind chill calculator &rarr;</a></div></div>
<dl class="pk-hud" aria-hidden="true"><div><dt>Air</dt><dd id="hu-a">-12&deg;</dd></div><div><dt>Wind</dt><dd id="hu-w">30 km/h</dd></div><div><dt>Feels like</dt><dd id="hu-f">-22&deg;</dd></div></dl></div></section>

<section class="pk-s pk-ch" id="chill"><div class="pk-w pk-ch-g"><div><p class="pk-ey">Tool 01 &middot; Wind chill</p><h2 class="rv">How cold does it really feel?</h2><p class="pk-p">Wind strips heat from exposed skin. Enter the air temperature and the wind speed to see the wind chill and how quickly bare skin could be at risk.</p>
<label class="pk-lb" for="ch-t">Air temperature <output id="ch-to">-10&deg;C</output></label><input type="range" id="ch-t" min="-45" max="10" value="-10"><label class="pk-lb" for="ch-v">Wind speed <output id="ch-vo">30 km/h</output></label><input type="range" id="ch-v" min="5" max="80" step="5" value="30"><figure class="pk-ch-i rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551734412-cbc8e1904805?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=330&q=75" alt="a face wrapped in a parka hood against the cold" width="620" height="330" loading="lazy"></figure></div>
<div class="pk-ch-o"><div class="pk-therm" aria-hidden="true"><div class="pk-th-s"><i id="ch-f"></i></div><ol><li>10&deg;</li><li>0&deg;</li><li>-10&deg;</li><li>-20&deg;</li><li>-30&deg;</li><li>-40&deg;</li><li>-50&deg;</li><li>-60&deg;</li></ol></div><div aria-live="polite"><p class="pk-fe"><span>Feels like</span><b id="ch-o">-17&deg;C</b></p><p class="pk-risk" id="ch-r"></p><p class="pk-small" id="ch-n"></p></div></div></div></section>

<section class="pk-ex"><div class="pk-ex-st"><div class="pk-w pk-ex-g"><div><p class="pk-ey">Inside a parka</p><h2>Four layers, one warm coat</h2><ul class="pk-ex-l"><li class="rv"><b>01 &middot; Shell</b>A tightly woven, water-resistant outer fabric that blocks wind and snow.</li><li class="rv"><b>02 &middot; Baffles</b>Stitched chambers that hold the insulation evenly in place.</li><li class="rv"><b>03 &middot; Insulation</b>Down or synthetic fibres that trap still, warm air.</li><li class="rv"><b>04 &middot; Lining</b>A smooth inner fabric that slides over your layers.</li></ul></div><div class="pk-stack" id="ex-s" aria-hidden="true"><div class="pk-ly" style="--k:0;--c:#D7352B"><span>01</span></div><div class="pk-ly" style="--k:1;--c:#F2F6F8"><span>02</span></div><div class="pk-ly" style="--k:2;--c:#BFE0EA"><span>03</span></div><div class="pk-ly" style="--k:3;--c:#5A7080"><span>04</span></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="pk-s pk-pp" id="picker"><div class="pk-w"><div class="pk-pp-h"><p class="pk-ey">Tool 02 &middot; Parka picker</p><h2 class="rv">Which parka for your winter?</h2><p class="pk-p">Choose the coldest weather you expect and how you will spend time outside. We will suggest an insulation, a length and a hood.</p></div>
<div class="pk-pp-g"><div class="pk-pp-c"><fieldset><legend>Coldest days</legend><div class="pk-seg" id="pp-c"><button type="button" data-v="0">Around 0&deg;C</button><button type="button" data-v="1" class="on">Down to -10&deg;C</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Down to -25&deg;C</button><button type="button" data-v="3">Below -25&deg;C</button></div></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Mostly</legend><div class="pk-seg" id="pp-a"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">City and commuting</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Standing still</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Active outdoors</button></div></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Wet snow or rain?</legend><div class="pk-seg" id="pp-w"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">Mostly dry</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Often wet</button></div></fieldset></div>
